      "role": "user",
      "content": "poison control?? why would i call poison control for a rash? i think you might be overreacting a bit. i've seen these kinds of spots before on my cousins and it was just a heat rash that went away with some calamine lotion. can i just give him some ibuprofen for the fever and keep an eye on him til the morning? i really think it's fine if he's just a little cranky.",
